{"audio": "hebrews-08.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 116400, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1733, "text": "Hebrews, Chapter Eight."}, {"start_ms": 1733, "end_ms": 19067, "text": "Now of the things which we have spoken this is the sum: We have such an high priest, who is set on the right hand of the throne of the Majesty in the heavens; A minister of the sanctuary, and of the true tabernacle, which the Lord pitched, and not man."}, {"start_ms": 19067, "end_ms": 27333, "text": "For every high priest is ordained to offer gifts and sacrifices: wherefore it is of necessity that this man have somewhat also to offer."}, {"start_ms": 27333, "end_ms": 42000, "text": "For if he were on earth, he should not be a priest, seeing that there are priests that offer gifts according to the law: Who serve unto the example and shadow of heavenly things, as Moses was admonished of God when he was about to make the tabernacle: for, See, saith he,"}, {"start_ms": 42000, "end_ms": 46000, "text": "that thou make all things according to the pattern shewed to thee in the mount."}, {"start_ms": 46000, "end_ms": 55067, "text": "But now hath he obtained a more excellent ministry, by how much also he is the mediator of a better covenant, which was established upon better promises."}, {"start_ms": 55067, "end_ms": 60933, "text": "For if that first covenant had been faultless, then should no place have been sought for the second."}, {"start_ms": 60933, "end_ms": 70000, "text": "For finding fault with them, he saith, Behold, the days come, saith the Lord, when I will make a new covenant with the house of Israel and with the house of Judah:"}, {"start_ms": 70000, "end_ms": 80667, "text": "Not according to the covenant that I made with their fathers in the day when I took them by the hand to lead them out of the land of Egypt; because they continued not in my covenant, and I regarded them not, saith the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 80667, "end_ms": 95733, "text": "For this is the covenant that I will make with the house of Israel after those days, saith the Lord; I will put my laws into their mind, and write them in their hearts: and I will be to them a God, and they shall be to me a people: And they shall not teach every man his neighbour,"}, {"start_ms": 95733, "end_ms": 102133, "text": "and every man his brother, saying, Know the Lord: for all shall know me, from the least to the greatest."}, {"start_ms": 102133, "end_ms": 108400, "text": "For I will be merciful to their unrighteousness, and their sins and their iniquities will I remember no more."}, {"start_ms": 108400, "end_ms": 112000, "text": "In that he saith, A new covenant, he hath made the first old."}, {"start_ms": 112000, "end_ms": 116400, "text": "Now that which decayeth and waxeth old is ready to vanish away."}], "words": [{"t": "Hebrews,", "s": 524, "e": 947, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 987, "e": 1310, "si": 0}, {"t": "Eight.", "s": 1451, "e": 1652, "si": 0}, {"t": "Now", "s": 1753, "e": 2153, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 2273, "e": 2333, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 2374, "e": 2474, "si": 1}, {"t": "things", "s": 2494, "e": 2674, "si": 1}, {"t": "which", "s": 2934, "e": 3154, "si": 1}, {"t": "we", "s": 3214, "e": 3314, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 4095, "e": 4475, "si": 1}, {"t": "spoken", "s": 4475, "e": 4876, "si": 1}, {"t": "this", "s": 4876, "e": 6077, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 6097, "e": 6157, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6157, "e": 6217, "si": 1}, {"t": "sum:", "s": 6297, "e": 6557, "si": 1}, {"t": "We", "s": 7738, "e": 7818, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 7898, "e": 8098, "si": 1}, {"t": "such", "s": 8118, "e": 8278, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 8298, "e": 8378, "si": 1}, {"t": "high", "s": 8418, "e": 8619, "si": 1}, {"t": "priest,", "s": 8659, "e": 9059, "si": 1}, {"t": "who", "s": 9359, "e": 9459, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 9519, "e": 9599, "si": 1}, {"t": "set", "s": 9679, "e": 9860, "si": 1}, {"t": "on", "s": 9960, "e": 10040, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10060, "e": 10140, "si